  <scopecontent id="af34ab6e72f6ccac5b7adb47a26fbb91">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The collection contains prints, slides, and negatives from Ford Foundation program events and projects, including the Operation Life Community Development's grand opening, artwork from Black and Hispanic art museums, the Program Associates Farewell Reception, and visits to the Philippines.</p>  </scopecontent>
